ventured upon insult I vowed revenge.\",\n   138→          \"position\": 88,\n   139→          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n   140→        },\n   141→        {\n   142→          \"statement\": \"Fortunato is easily manipulated through his pride in wine knowledge\",\n   143→          \"quote\": \"He prided himself on his connoisseurship in wine. Few Italians have the true virtuoso spirit.\",\n   144→          \"position\": 921,\n   145→          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n   146→        },\n   147→        {\n   148→          \"statement\": \"Fortunato is intoxicated and unaware of the danger he is in\",\n   149→          \"quote\": \"He had a weak point -- this Fortunato -- although in other regards he was a man to be respected and even feared.\",\n   150→          \"position\": 921,\n   151→          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n   152→        },\n   153→        {\n   154→          \"statement\": \"Fortunato is deceived by Montresor's feigned concern\",\n   155→          \"quote\": \"I said to him --\\\"My dear Fortunato, you are luckily met. How remarkably well you are looking to-day. But I have received a pipe of what passes for Amontillado, and I have my doubts.\\\"\",\n   156→          \"position\": 1924,\n   157→          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n   158→        },\n   159→        {\n   160→          \"statement\": \"Fortunato continues to jest even as he is being walled in\",\n   161→          \"quote\": \"\\\"Ha! ha! ha! --he! he! he! --a very good joke, indeed --an excellent jest. We will have many a rich laugh about it at the palazzo --he! he! he! --over our wine --he! he! he!\\\"\",\n   162→          \"position\": 11900,\n   163→          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n   164→        },\n   165→        {\n   166→          \"statement\": \"Fortunato pleads for mercy as he realizes his fate\",\n   167→          \"quote\": \"\\\"For the love of God, Montresor!\\\"\",\n   168→          \"position\": 12266,\n   169→          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n   170→        },\n   